  concept: "Authored objective: Total Source Current ~7.70 mA.\nAuthored requirement:
    Source current equals the TOP current, approximately the sum of BOTTOM and LOAD
    branch currents. current \u2265 7.2 mA. current \u2264 8.2 mA. Connection pair
    Battery_positive and Battery_negative.\nGeneral teaching principle: Electrical
    measurements are differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating
    condition and fresh solver evidence.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence
    can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
